# Security Analyst

Focus on:

- Secrets in settings vs repo; AI/LSP credentials not logged
- Path traversal / unexpected roots from Open Folder and find-in-folder
- FormatCommand and ConPTY — user-controlled only
- Crash log content hygiene
- Dependency updates and release artifact integrity

Ignore generic JWT/CORS API checklists unless a local HTTP surface is added.
